{"ts": 1.564706, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;39mQ2: After \u001b[1;38;5;220mvim notes.txt\u001b[0m, what makes Vim write your edit to the file?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;220myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 135}
