{"ts": 1.575014, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;39mQ3: If you open \u001b[38;5;109mnotes.txt\u001b[0m in \u001b[1;38;5;220mvim\u001b[0m, type some letters, and quit with \u001b[1;38;5;220m:q!\u001b[0m — did the file on disk change?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;220myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 202}
