{"ts": 1.592786, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;208mSTAGE 5 — GATE TASK (phase 1 of 2)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nI've reset \u001b[38;5;109mpractice.txt\u001b[0m to contain just the word \u001b[1;38;5;244mbefore\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\nAt the practice prompt:\r\n\r\n  1. \u001b[1;38;5;220mcat practice.txt\u001b[0m        \u001b[2m# confirm it says 'before'\u001b[0m\r\n  2. \u001b[1;38;5;220mvim practice.txt\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[1;38;5;220mi\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m# enter insert mode\u001b[0m\r\n       type a few letters\r\n       \u001b[38;5;208mEsc\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[1;38;5;220m:q!\u001b[0m  Enter   \u001b[2m# discard your changes\u001b[0m\r\n  3. \u001b[1;38;5;220mcat practice.txt\u001b[0m        \u001b[2m# should still say 'before'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[1;38;5;220mcheck\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mI will verify the file is still exactly 'before'.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;208m▶ Type \u001b[1;38;5;220mcheck\u001b[1;38;5;208m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 730}
{"ts": 1.592957, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 1.611328, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[2m(type \u001b[1;38;5;220mcheck\u001b[0m\u001b[2m when done — or \u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;220mshow\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;220mprev\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;220mquit\u001b[2m)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 140}
