{"ts": 2.16926, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;208mSTAGE 5 — GATE TASK (phase 2 of 2)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nNow save a real edit.\r\n\r\n  1. \u001b[1;38;5;220mvim practice.txt\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[1;38;5;220mi\u001b[0m, type at least one letter, \u001b[38;5;208mEsc\u001b[0m\r\n       \u001b[1;38;5;220m:wq\u001b[0m  Enter   \u001b[2m# write and quit\u001b[0m\r\n  2. \u001b[1;38;5;220mcat practice.txt\u001b[0m        \u001b[2m# now it differs from 'before'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[1;38;5;220mcheck\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mI will verify the file is no longer exactly 'before'.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;208m▶ Type \u001b[1;38;5;220mcheck\u001b[1;38;5;208m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 518}
{"ts": 2.16955, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 2.193729, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[2m(type \u001b[1;38;5;220mcheck\u001b[0m\u001b[2m when done — or \u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;220mshow\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;220mprev\u001b[2m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;38;5;220mquit\u001b[2m)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 140}
