{"ts": 2.754481, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;38;5;208mYou're ready for vimtutor.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nAcross five stages you have met:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;244mcommands\u001b[0m    echo, pwd, whoami, date, clear, exit,\r\n                ls, cd, ~, .., touch, mkdir, rmdir,\r\n                cat, less, cp, mv, rm,\r\n                command -v, wc, seq, head, sort, grep,\r\n                man, vim, vim --version, vimtutor\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;244mkeys\u001b[0m        Tab, Up Arrow, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+L, q, Esc\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;244moperators\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;38;5;220m|\u001b[0m (pipe)  \u001b[1;38;5;220m>\u001b[0m (redirect)  \u001b[1;38;5;220m>>\u001b[0m (append)\r\n                \u001b[1;38;5;220m<\u001b[0m (input)  \u001b[1;38;5;220m*\u001b[0m (glob)\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;244mideas\u001b[0m       prompt vs program  ·  buffer vs file\r\n                relative vs absolute paths\r\n                file is not changed until the buffer is written\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;38;5;244mWhat's next\u001b[0m:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;220mvimtutor\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m# the Vim tutor itself; about 30 minutes, hands-on\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nIf \u001b[1;38;5;220mvimtutor\u001b[0m isn't installed:\r\n  - Linux: install your distro's full vim package\r\n    ", "len": 1024}
{"ts": 2.754625, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "(Fedora: \u001b[1;38;5;220msudo dnf install vim-enhanced\u001b[0m; Debian/Ubuntu: \u001b[1;38;5;220msudo apt install vim\u001b[0m)\r\n  - macOS:  \u001b[1;38;5;220mbrew install vim\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nRe-take any stage at any time:\r\n  \u001b[1;38;5;220mshelltutor 1\u001b[0m   \u001b[2m# replay Stage 1\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSandbox stays at \u001b[38;5;109m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-jih7e272\u001b[0m if you want to keep playing.\r\n\r\n", "len": 397}
